# Production Caddy config — NOT active on the TEST server.
#
# Enable only at cutover, after the stack passes smoke tests on nip.io.
# Steps:
#   1. Replace the TEST blocks in Caddyfile with the blocks below (or include this file).
#   2. Update NEXTAUTH_URL in .env to https://app.lovedis.de
#   3. Lower DNS TTL 24 h ahead, then point A/AAAA records at the server IP.
#   4. docker compose exec caddy caddy reload --config /etc/caddy/Caddyfile
#   5. Smoke-test lovedis.de + app.lovedis.de before decommissioning old hosts.
#
# DO NOT apply while lovedis.de still serves production traffic elsewhere.

